# Pyrogoyf: whenever it or another Lhurgoyf creature you control enters, that creature deals damage equal to its power to
# any target. Cast into empty graveyards on turn one it is a 0/1 and deals nothing. On turn three, with a Lightning Bolt
# and the Island Bot2 discarded to hand size in graveyards (two types), a Barrowgoyf (power 2, lifelink) enters and it is the Barrowgoyf that deals the damage, so Bot1
# gains the life.

